# Documentation
# The prior whitelist below named docs that no longer exist in this repo (the
# 4 old, explicitly-superseded docs and other stale phase reports) — meaning
# EVERY update to the real, actively-maintained governance docs (Blueprint,
# Gap Audit, Demo Mode remediation log, production-readiness report) was
# silently excluded from every commit, across every phase, until this fix.
docs/*
!docs/NEOZY_MASTER_IMPLEMENTATION_BLUEPRINT.md
!docs/NEOZY_MASTER_BUSINESS_WORKFLOW_GAP_AUDIT.md
!docs/DEMO_MODE_BUSINESS_FLOW_REMEDIATION.md
!docs/NEOZY_PRODUCTION_READINESS_REPORT.md
!docs/CSGPL_BRANDING_FIREBASE_MIGRATION_REPORT.md

